    "--- \n",
    "## 4. Scope & Capability Disclaimer\n",
    "\n",
    "> ⚠️ **IMPORTANT ARCHITECTURAL DISCLAIMER**:\n",
    "> The adaptive workflow implemented here simulates **periodic, drift-triggered batch retraining**. When distribution drift is detected by statistical monitors (KS-Test / PSI), the system triggers a automated retraining pipeline using combined historical and new batch data. This architecture represents **drift-triggered batch retraining**, NOT true sample-by-sample continuous online streaming updates (which will be implemented using River algorithms in future phases)."
   ]
